      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe one of the original design objectives was also a third capability that combined both low-latency (just called latency here) and bandwidth. Unclear how one would prioritize both. The original question remains about the expected behavior if a \"priority\" slice isn\u0027t available; I shudder to think of the matching code that uses priority like a hint and doesn\u0027t match against it?",
      "revId": "7baea05a14693583b55a26dc33be4cde56f2ba41",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
