        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-25T07:07:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes it will be like any other network, but that behavior is not onLost. That behavior is that the request stays standing until the network becomes available or the app withdraws it. This is how requests have always worked and this capability is like any other.",
